{"seq":1,"slug":"hooks-retention","title":"开场钩子与留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/storytelling-narrative/audio-podcast-storytelling/audience/hooks-retention","wordCount":1736,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"开场钩子与留存\">开场钩子与留存</h1><p>播客创作者最残酷的真相是：大多数流失发生在前几分钟。一个潜在的忠实听众，会因为开头三十秒的拖沓、寒暄、自我介绍而永远离开——他根本没听到你后面精彩的内容。开场钩子不是锦上添花，而是决定一期节目能否被真正「听见」的生死线。本篇讲清楚如何在最初的几十秒抓住听众，以及如何让他听完整期、还想听下一期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>留存优化的核心概念围绕「听众在哪里离开」与「为什么留下」展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>留存曲线</strong>：横轴进度、纵轴仍在收听的比例；最陡下跌几乎总在前一两分钟的「试听期」，其后转入缓慢平稳的衰减。</li>\n<li><strong>冷开场（cold open）</strong>：跳过寒暄与片头，直接把听众扔进最精彩的瞬间；开场 60 秒必须建立利害关系。</li>\n<li><strong>好奇缺口（curiosity gap）</strong>：钩子制造一个未闭合的回路；强度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(p)=kp(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 最大，太晦涩或剧透都失效。</li>\n<li><strong>两个发力点</strong>：堵开头的悬崖式下跌（钩子）与拉平中段的缓慢衰减（节奏）。</li>\n<li><strong>长期粘性</strong>：由稳定更新节奏、一致节目人格与社群感构成，更深的根基是准社会关系——听众为那个熟悉的声音而回来。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"留存曲线-流失发生在哪里\">留存曲线：流失发生在哪里</h2><p>要做好留存，先得看清听众在哪里离开。播客分析后台普遍提供「留存曲线」——横轴是节目进度，纵轴是仍在收听的听众比例。几乎所有节目的留存曲线都有共同的形状，认清它你才知道力气该往哪使。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[听众点开节目] --&gt; B[前30-60秒&lt;br/&gt;最大流失段]&#10;  B --&gt; C{钩子是否&lt;br/&gt;抓住?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[直接退出&lt;br/&gt;大量流失]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[进入主体&lt;br/&gt;缓慢流失]&#10;  E --&gt; F{节奏是否&lt;br/&gt;维持?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[中途流失]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[听到结尾]&#10;  H --&gt; I[结尾钩子&lt;br/&gt;引向下一集]&#10;  I --&gt; J[转化为订阅/回访]\">flowchart TD\n  A[听众点开节目] --&gt; B[前30-60秒&lt;br/&gt;最大流失段]\n  B --&gt; C{钩子是否&lt;br/&gt;抓住?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[直接退出&lt;br/&gt;大量流失]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[进入主体&lt;br/&gt;缓慢流失]\n  E --&gt; F{节奏是否&lt;br/&gt;维持?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[中途流失]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[听到结尾]\n  H --&gt; I[结尾钩子&lt;br/&gt;引向下一集]\n  I --&gt; J[转化为订阅/回访]</pre><p>留存曲线最陡的下跌几乎总在最初一两分钟——这是「试听期」，听众在快速判断这期值不值得继续。挺过这一段后，曲线进入缓慢平稳的衰减，对应 <a href=\"../foundations/auditory-attention-pacing\">听觉注意力与节奏</a> 里讲的注意力自然衰减。因此留存优化有两个发力点：把开头的悬崖式下跌堵住（钩子），和把中段的缓慢衰减拉平（节奏）。这两点在分析层面如何度量，是 <a href=\"data-iteration\">数据反馈与迭代</a> 的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷开场-钩子的形态\">冷开场：钩子的形态</h2><p>抓住开头最有效的武器是「冷开场」（cold open）——跳过所有寒暄与片头，直接把听众扔进一个最精彩的瞬间。一段紧张的录音、一个惊人的问题、一句让人非听不可的悬念，先声夺人，等钩子咬住了再放片头音乐和介绍。这与 2026 年主流叙事播客的共识一致：开场 60 秒必须建立利害关系，常用 cold open 把听众丢进一个进行中的场景（来源：podcastingauthority.com《Podcast Storytelling Techniques》）。</p>\n<p>钩子有几种可靠的形态，下面这张表把它们摊开对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>钩子类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>悬念冷开场</td>\n<td>抛出未解的谜题</td>\n<td>叙事纪实、音频剧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高光预告</td>\n<td>先放后面最精彩的片段</td>\n<td>访谈、纪实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惊人陈述</td>\n<td>一句反常识的断言</td>\n<td>解释类、观点类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利害提问</td>\n<td>一个与听众切身相关的问题</td>\n<td>各类形式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入戏场景</td>\n<td>直接进入一个具体时空</td>\n<td>叙事纪实、音频剧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>钩子的共同内核是「制造一个未闭合的回路」——让听众心里悬着一个非要听下去才能解决的问题。人脑厌恶未闭合的认知缺口，这种「好奇缺口」（curiosity gap）就是把听众拽过试听期的引力。不同形式的钩子选择不同：<a href=\"../formats/interview-conversation\">访谈与对话节目</a> 常用高光预告，<a href=\"../formats/narrative-documentary\">叙事纪实播客</a> 与 <a href=\"../formats/serial-audio-drama\">连续剧与音频剧</a> 则偏爱悬念冷开场与入戏场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"好奇缺口的数学直觉\">好奇缺口的数学直觉</h2><p>为什么钩子有效、又为什么不能滥用？可以借「好奇缺口」模型建立直觉。心理学认为好奇心强度在「已知太少」和「已知太多」时都低，在中间某点最强。设听众对答案的好奇强度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，已掌握信息比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(p) = k \\, p \\, (1 - p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（完全不知道在讲什么），听众无从产生好奇；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（已经全知道），好奇消失。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 处最大。这解释了一个常见失误：钩子若太晦涩（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 太低，听众连谜题是什么都没搞懂），抓不住人；若把谜底也一并剧透（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 太高），也抓不住人。好的钩子要把听众放在「知道有个值得追的问题、但还不知道答案」的甜区。</p>\n<p>这个甜区也适用于整期节目的悬念管理：每解决一个问题就要抛出新的问题，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 始终在那个让好奇维持的区间内移动，而不是一口气把所有谜底揭完导致后半段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\to1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、好奇归零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单期留存到长期粘性\">从单期留存到长期粘性</h2><p>抓住一期是战术，留住一个长期听众是战略。单期的结尾钩子（cliffhanger 或「下期预告」）把听众引向下一集，这是 <a href=\"../formats/serial-audio-drama\">连续剧与音频剧</a> 培养追更习惯的同款机制。但长期粘性更深的来源，是 <a href=\"../foundations/sound-as-medium\">声音作为叙事媒介</a> 里讲的准社会关系——听众回来，往往不只为内容，更为那个他觉得熟悉、信任的声音。</p>\n<p>构建长期粘性有几条可操作的杠杆：稳定的更新节奏（让收听成为习惯的一部分）、一致的节目人格（让听众认得出「这是我喜欢的那档」）、以及主动经营的社群感（回复听众、采纳建议，让单向的准社会关系生出一点双向温度）。2026 年的数据印证了粘性的价值：美国 12 岁以上人群月活收听率达 58%、创历史新高（来源：Edison Research 2026），但在如此庞大的供给里，能把一次性收听转化为习惯性回访的节目才是真正的赢家。这种转化的度量与优化，正是下一篇 <a href=\"data-iteration\">数据反馈与迭代</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大多数流失发生在前一两分钟的「试听期」，留存优化有两个发力点：堵开头的悬崖（钩子）与拉平中段的衰减（节奏）。</li>\n<li>冷开场是最有效的钩子：跳过寒暄直接进入最精彩的瞬间，开场 60 秒必须建立利害关系。</li>\n<li>钩子的内核是制造未闭合的「好奇缺口」，强度约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(p)=kp(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 最大——太晦涩或剧透都失效。</li>\n<li>整期悬念管理要让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 始终停在好奇甜区：每解一个问题就抛一个新问题，别一口气揭完所有谜底。</li>\n<li>长期粘性靠稳定节奏、一致人格与社群感，更深的根基是准社会关系——听众为那个熟悉的声音而回来。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开场钩子与留存","id":"开场钩子与留存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"留存曲线：流失发生在哪里","id":"留存曲线-流失发生在哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"冷开场：钩子的形态","id":"冷开场-钩子的形态"},{"level":2,"text":"好奇缺口的数学直觉","id":"好奇缺口的数学直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"从单期留存到长期粘性","id":"从单期留存到长期粘性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剪辑与混音叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/storytelling-narrative/audio-podcast-storytelling/production/editing-mixing-narrative"},"next":{"title":"平台与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/storytelling-narrative/audio-podcast-storytelling/audience/platforms-discovery"}}